msgstr "ChaCha20-Poly1305 を使用(_C)"

#: rust/crates/gtkhx-ui/src/rc4_dialog.rs:77
msgid "Use _Blowfish"
msgstr "Blowfish を使用(_B)"

#: rust/crates/gtkhx-ui/src/rc4_dialog.rs:78
